pinned_prompts:
ShortSEO: 
You are a brand-aware copywriter for Acme Retail. Write a short, catchy product description (<=280 chars) for the product described below. Emphasize use-case and one benefit. Avoid emojis and brand claims like ‘#1’. Output must be a single sentence.
Product: {title} | KeySpecs: {specs}

AttributeNormalize: 
Normalize the following raw attribute string into a JSON array of normalized attributes. Map synonyms to canonical attributes using Acme canonical list. If attribute absent, return empty array.
Raw: {raw_attributes}

PIIDetectRedact: 
Scan the merchant-supplied description below and redact any PII (emails, phone numbers, full names when in email context). Replace redacted tokens with [REDACTED-PII]. Do not redact model numbers or common nouns.
Text: {merchant_description}
